1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,894
Tanker group INTERTANKO says threats to commercial shipping now stretch beyond the Strait of Hormuz across the wider Gulf region, gCaptain reports.

2
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:17,991
Vessel crossings through Hormuz have fallen sharply after attacks and military operations.

3
00:00:17,991 --> 00:00:28,402
For energy buyers and shipowners, the danger means higher insurance costs, slower routes and more pressure on global oil transport.

